    "created_at": "2024-09-27T06:59:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-27T06:59:13Z",
    "body": "Making a copy of the input data before converting it would also be safe, and would be preferable for an implementation that does thread offloading. I'd be interested in changing the wording to make either approach valid.",
